WEBVTT

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:07.360
It's why I'm going to live in this town

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:14.530
I'm watching an endless dream

00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:21.000
Aren't you watching too?

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:28.340
It's always close by no matter how far away it seems

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:35.180
Can't you see it too?

00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:40.600
The things you can't normally say

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:43.350
The things you try to express

00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:45.850
The things you're willing to fight for

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:51.570
Standing on your own two feet

00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:58.240
The night sky illuminates them all

00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:05.370
The first flash of lightning

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:11.710
This is our battle to fight

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:19.050
It's why I'm going to live in this town

00:01:19.350 --> 00:01:27.520
This dream will absolutely come true

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:35.700
Captain Earth

00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:41.330
I'll install myself into every sentient
life form in the galaxy,

00:01:41.740 --> 00:01:44.830
and become this galaxy's true god!

00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:48.500
With the one thing that could threaten me,

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:51.790
the Boosted Plazmagnum, gone,

00:01:51.790 --> 00:01:57.510
my Ego Block can only be destroyed
by my own will, making me invincible!

00:01:58.050 --> 00:02:00.930
That ugly clump is an Ego Block?

00:02:00.930 --> 00:02:05.560
A mere control system for <i>Oberon</i> cannot
be allowed to have an Ego Block!

00:02:05.560 --> 00:02:12.480
Even without life, an Ego Block can
exist as long as there is desire, right?

00:02:17.650 --> 00:02:19.740
A planetary sign?

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:26.450
A planetary sign...

00:02:26.450 --> 00:02:29.870
Anyone with an Ego Block can use it.

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:32.540
Of course I can, as well.

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:37.510
And its strength is proportional
to your libido's strength.

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:42.970
No one without an Ego Block can break this sign.

00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:46.600
Daichi! Teppei!

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:53.230
How does it feel to be ruled by that which you used?

00:02:53.610 --> 00:02:55.570
Well, Amarok?

00:02:57.030 --> 00:03:00.450
That rage is the rage of something that's been used.

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:03.490
You're the same, Earthlings!

00:03:03.490 --> 00:03:10.160
You used the <i>Blume</i> to protect your race,
and locked Mutou Hana inside it.

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:14.380
As a bio-part, she is deeply connected to the <i>Blume</i>,

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:16.840
and won't be able to leave it anymore.

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:20.300
At least, not for another few centuries...

00:03:22.550 --> 00:03:24.180
Is that true, Teppei?

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:26.640
Hana made her decision.

00:03:27.270 --> 00:03:28.890
She believed in this team.

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:31.140
No...

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:35.860
I'll bring back Hana, even if it
means destroying the <i>Blume</i>.

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:40.240
If you destroy the ship, Mutou Hana will die.

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:47.450
I have gained an Ego Block and evolved into
a new life form, but she's just a bio-part.

00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:49.160
Hana is human!

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:01.550
Only death can cure a fool, I suppose.

00:04:06.050 --> 00:04:07.140
Aiatar!

00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:08.760
What is this?

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:10.560
My body's going weird...

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:18.270
An Entangle Link?

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:32.500
Thanks, Teppei...

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:35.500
That Ego Block Entangle Linked.

00:04:39.550 --> 00:04:41.420
Where did Pac go?

00:04:46.640 --> 00:04:49.890
Don't worry, Midsummer's Knights.

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:54.730
The <i>Blume</i> and Mutou Hana will live forever with me.

00:04:55.020 --> 00:04:55.600
Hana!

00:04:55.900 --> 00:04:58.310
Pac does not lie.

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:22.210
Hana!

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:35.100
Now, come out, Princess of <i>Blume</i>.

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:57.750
At last I have it...

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:05.920
The body I wanted more than anything, and this.

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:20.610
Pac installed himself in the <i>Blume</i>?

00:06:21.020 --> 00:06:24.690
I am no longer Pac nor the <i>Blume</i>.

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:33.330
I am Robin Goodfellow,

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:37.080
the absolute ruler of this galaxy.

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:41.210
Robin Goodfellow?

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:42.790
Hana?

00:06:43.090 --> 00:06:46.050
What is this monster?

00:06:49.970 --> 00:06:55.180
Now, show me infinite energy.

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:13.450
Why?

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:16.160
Why can't I fire the Livlaster?

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:19.250
Why isn't there infinite energy?!

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:21.460
So that's it...

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:23.790
She can't fire the Livlaster?

00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:25.800
Of course not.

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:29.130
That may be Hana's body, but it isn't Hana.

00:07:34.890 --> 00:07:37.640
So these things are my true enemies, after all.

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:40.690
If I can't control them,

00:07:40.690 --> 00:07:47.110
I'll have to eliminate all civilizations that have
touched the Livlasters from my new world!

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:00.910
Captain! Teppei!

00:08:00.910 --> 00:08:02.290
Let's get Hana back!

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:03.710
Roger!

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:08.000
We cannot allow that thing to exist!

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:33.070
Lady Seiren, there's no end to this.

00:08:33.530 --> 00:08:37.910
There's no way to destroy it except
with an Ego Block explosion.

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:42.290
Lady Seiren,

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:46.750
ever since you got an Earthling avatar,
you've been acting strangely.

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:52.260
Losing your Ego Block means you aren't
one of the Planetary Gears anymore!

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:54.630
Captain!

00:08:57.510 --> 00:09:03.310
If we don't wipe that thing out here,
it will absorb the entire galaxy.

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:09.860
We Planetary Gears created that mass of desire.

00:09:11.730 --> 00:09:17.200
I think I finally understand why
we cannot fire the Livlasters.

00:09:17.870 --> 00:09:22.910
Because we're monsters with
swollen egos, just like that thing.

00:09:23.410 --> 00:09:29.750
But I never would've realized that if not for
the time I spent as an Earthling avatar.

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:33.460
Perhaps we should entrust ourselves
to a momentary wind...

00:09:35.010 --> 00:09:36.630
A wind, huh?

00:09:36.930 --> 00:09:40.390
No way... I don't believe it.

00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:42.350
You can't do that!

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:47.770
How is it so fast, with that size?

00:09:49.810 --> 00:09:50.820
Captain!

00:09:50.820 --> 00:09:51.770
Captain!

00:09:51.770 --> 00:09:53.320
What are you doing?

00:09:54.400 --> 00:09:55.190
Die.

00:09:58.570 --> 00:09:59.070
What?

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:03.540
I just don't like owing a debt to anyone.

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:05.040
D-Debt?

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:10.170
Thanks for teaching me that
the wind could feel good.

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:16.720
Now, if the power of your planetary sign
is proportional to your libido's power...

00:10:17.220 --> 00:10:19.720
My libido's strong!

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:21.800
As strong as yours!

00:10:21.800 --> 00:10:23.060
You think so?

00:10:30.520 --> 00:10:31.360
Moco...

00:10:34.530 --> 00:10:38.820
That crêpe truck we ran together
was pretty fun, wasn't it?

00:10:39.410 --> 00:10:40.740
What are you talking about?

00:10:50.290 --> 00:10:51.710
Amara?

00:11:02.010 --> 00:11:04.220
No way... Amarok?

00:11:05.140 --> 00:11:09.440
He sacrificed his Ego Block so I could survive...

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:16.650
What is the meaning of life?

00:11:17.900 --> 00:11:20.200
Someday, death will come...

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:23.030
Before then, you do what you must.

00:11:23.570 --> 00:11:28.790
They said that the strength of those
feelings becomes your power.

00:11:28.790 --> 00:11:31.330
Is that what it means to be alive?

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:34.540
Probably.

00:11:35.380 --> 00:11:39.550
In that case, we can only do what we must.

00:11:40.930 --> 00:11:42.130
We'll go with you.

00:11:52.440 --> 00:11:53.940
The Kill-T-Gangs!

00:11:53.940 --> 00:11:55.690
Ego Block explosions?

00:11:55.690 --> 00:11:56.980
No way!

00:12:16.630 --> 00:12:18.210
Akari, are you all right?

00:12:18.960 --> 00:12:22.930
Thanks to your barrier, there are no major problems.

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:25.340
What happened to him?

00:12:26.220 --> 00:12:27.220
Did we kill him?

00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:32.690
Signal at one o'clock!

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:41.900
Fools...

00:12:41.900 --> 00:12:47.660
In the end, the Planetary Gears
could not escape being human?

00:12:48.370 --> 00:12:51.870
But that took a lot of my strength...

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:54.620
I need energy.

00:12:59.210 --> 00:13:00.420
Oh, no!

00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:02.170
It's going to jump to Earth!

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:04.680
You can jump, right, Captain?

00:13:05.010 --> 00:13:08.970
Destroy that monster and get Hana back!

00:13:08.970 --> 00:13:09.890
Roger!

00:13:16.350 --> 00:13:18.810
Let's go, Livlaster.

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:39.330
Who are you, Manatsu Daichi?

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:46.720
You will never be able to meet this woman again.

00:13:47.550 --> 00:13:49.800
I will get Hana back.

00:13:49.800 --> 00:13:55.850
The key to the door that brought you
inside this ship is already mine.

00:13:56.440 --> 00:13:59.230
Then I'll destroy the door and go in.

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:03.190
You cannot stop me.

00:14:03.190 --> 00:14:05.530
I'll stop you, no matter what it takes.

00:14:21.630 --> 00:14:23.670
AEO signal confirmed.

00:14:23.670 --> 00:14:25.050
The Kill-T-Gangs?

00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:26.170
Video incoming.

00:14:27.880 --> 00:14:29.180
What is this?

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:30.800
The <i>Blume</i>?

00:14:31.890 --> 00:14:32.930
Hana...

00:14:33.310 --> 00:14:35.310
The <i>Blume</i> transformed?

00:14:37.640 --> 00:14:41.360
Another Entangle Link is emerging behind the <i>Blume</i>.

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:42.900
What is it?

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:44.070
What's going on?

00:14:44.650 --> 00:14:46.900
You cannot protect anything.

00:14:47.740 --> 00:14:49.700
Not this girl,

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:52.570
or that blue planet!

00:14:52.910 --> 00:14:54.330
I will protect them!

00:14:58.210 --> 00:15:01.380
I'm Captain Earth!

00:15:03.540 --> 00:15:16.770
All the laughter, all the tears—everything happened just to meet you

00:15:15.970 --> 00:15:17.470
Always go

00:15:19.180 --> 00:15:20.890
On my own

00:15:22.560 --> 00:15:24.060
Always go

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:35.740
The wind blows my overflowing tears away (the wind blows them away)

00:15:35.950 --> 00:15:43.500
I try to reach out my hand time after time toward what's to come

00:15:36.490 --> 00:15:39.120
Roar, Stigmagnum!

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:49.210
I've been hurt before by careless words

00:15:49.210 --> 00:15:58.140
It's time I move forward with that unchangeable past

00:15:53.800 --> 00:15:57.930
Go!

00:15:58.140 --> 00:16:01.640
All the laughter, all the tears—

00:16:01.640 --> 00:16:11.280
everything that has happened brought me to you

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:17.330
All we have left is the future

00:16:12.650 --> 00:16:14.240
I'm sorry, Unit 2.

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:23.750
Please become our reason to continue living

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:30.460
And then the sun will once again shine on us

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:35.550
I see it!

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:53.490
That was mean.

00:16:55.610 --> 00:17:01.660
I told you that if you destroyed
this ship, I would die, as well.

00:17:02.160 --> 00:17:05.460
Can you even shoot me?

00:17:05.920 --> 00:17:10.050
You're in love with this bio-part, aren't you?

00:17:10.460 --> 00:17:14.170
Then obey me, and be my tool.

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:18.430
If you use your Livlaster for my benefit,

00:17:19.430 --> 00:17:22.390
I'll prepare a way for you to live with her.

00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:35.700
That's right. That's right.

00:17:36.200 --> 00:17:39.120
You can't shoot Mutou Hana—

00:17:47.210 --> 00:17:50.090
A telepathic kiss?

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:06.980
Is it you?

00:18:39.300 --> 00:18:41.050
Wake up, Hana.

00:18:47.890 --> 00:18:49.560
I knew you'd come.

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:53.150
I'm sorry I'm a little late.

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:59.280
You think taking back one
bio-part means you've won?

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:05.370
The bio-part called Mutou Hana cannot
control this ship any longer.

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:12.960
If you destroy my Ego Block,

00:19:12.960 --> 00:19:18.340
this ship with its huge mass,
will fall to Earth at its current speed.

00:19:18.340 --> 00:19:19.720
Is that all right with you?

00:19:21.090 --> 00:19:23.800
The whole planet's climate will change.

00:19:23.800 --> 00:19:25.760
Earth will become a dead planet.

00:19:33.440 --> 00:19:39.820
And if this body is destroyed, that bio-part will die.

00:19:39.820 --> 00:19:43.160
Put down your Livlaster, Manatsu Daichi.

00:19:44.240 --> 00:19:49.200
If you obey me, I'll save you both.

00:19:50.120 --> 00:19:53.000
Pac does not lie—

00:19:54.580 --> 00:19:55.210
Hana!

00:19:56.130 --> 00:19:57.710
You do lie.

00:19:58.420 --> 00:20:02.470
The real reason you wanted this body is
because if you remain an Ego Block

00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:05.430
while you enter the Earth's atmosphere,
you'll cause a libido burst!

00:20:06.050 --> 00:20:07.430
You little...

00:20:07.850 --> 00:20:11.940
So I'll destroy this body before you can make it there!

00:20:12.810 --> 00:20:15.980
Please, Daichi... Help me.

00:20:17.860 --> 00:20:23.410
I want to protect that planet
where the people I love live.

00:20:23.820 --> 00:20:27.370
I want to protect the planet where I met you.

00:20:27.910 --> 00:20:31.460
I want to live on that planet in a way that,
no matter when I die, I won't regret it!

00:20:49.600 --> 00:20:51.600
So that's it, huh?

00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:52.980
Dad...

00:20:53.440 --> 00:20:59.400
Without the Boosted, you are powerless to hurt me!

00:20:59.940 --> 00:21:02.030
Power doesn't come first.

00:21:02.030 --> 00:21:02.860
What?

00:21:03.400 --> 00:21:05.160
Your feelings come first!

00:21:05.950 --> 00:21:07.280
That's right.

00:21:08.620 --> 00:21:13.750
And we've always turned the strength
of our feelings into power!

00:21:22.130 --> 00:21:24.090
What?!

00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:31.600
Stop! What are you doing?

00:21:48.620 --> 00:21:54.540
Now you've done it, Mutou Hana... Manatsu Daichi!

00:21:56.460 --> 00:21:57.170
Hana!

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:00.880
I want to leave here and live with you!

00:22:01.920 --> 00:22:03.630
Let's survive! Together!

00:22:05.550 --> 00:22:10.010
If I'm going to die, I'll take you with me!

00:22:18.440 --> 00:22:20.020
Hana!

00:22:33.290 --> 00:22:38.710
The day when dawn finally arrives

00:22:38.710 --> 00:22:42.920
Even if someone is missing

00:22:39.040 --> 00:22:40.750
Where are the captain and Hana?

00:22:42.920 --> 00:22:48.630
Even if we don't make it, or our wishes don't come true

00:22:44.090 --> 00:22:44.840
Hana!

00:22:48.630 --> 00:22:51.510
Today will begin

00:22:51.510 --> 00:22:54.350
I have to go

00:22:54.350 --> 00:23:03.520
All tragedy simply turns into memories

00:22:55.390 --> 00:22:56.270
Daichi...

00:23:03.520 --> 00:23:12.280
Yet another morning will come without any miracles

00:23:04.520 --> 00:23:05.650
Where's Amara?

00:23:05.940 --> 00:23:07.690
He left.

00:23:08.860 --> 00:23:09.650
Oh...

00:23:12.280 --> 00:23:18.040
I'm sure we'll miss each other again

00:23:18.040 --> 00:23:23.380
Tell me about yourself

00:23:20.540 --> 00:23:23.380
I'm back, Lappa.

00:23:23.380 --> 00:23:26.500
What those words you said meant

00:23:26.500 --> 00:23:29.090
These tears too

00:23:29.090 --> 00:23:34.760
The seasons may change, but I'm here again today

00:23:34.760 --> 00:23:39.850
I'm sure we'll meet each other again

00:23:39.850 --> 00:23:48.650
Our feelings will become the stardust in tomorrow's east sky

00:23:48.650 --> 00:23:53.660
Disappearing into the sky you love

00:24:00.500 --> 00:24:02.250
It's such a pretty galaxy...

00:24:03.170 --> 00:24:08.000
I love the view of space from this planet most of all.

00:24:09.760 --> 00:24:10.760
Me, too.
